  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "みずを　あっしゅくして　しゅりけんを\nつくりだす。こうそくかいてんさせて\nとばすと　きんぞくも　まっぷたつ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "물을 압축시켜 수리검을\n만들어 낸다. 고속으로 회전시키며\n던지면 금속도 두 동강이 난다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il transforme des jets d’eau sous pression\nen redoutables shuriken. Une fois lancés, ils tournent\nsi vite qu’ils peuvent même couper le métal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es stellt Wurfsterne aus komprimiertem Wasser\nher, die durch ihre hohe Drehgeschwindigkeit\nbeim Werfen sogar Metall durchtrennen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comprime el agua y crea estrellas ninja con las que\nataca al enemigo. Cuando las hace girar a gran\nvelocidad cortan en dos hasta el metal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Crea lame d’acqua micidiali che ruotano\nad alta velocità e, se lanciate, possono perforare\nil metallo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It creates throwing stars out of compressed water.\nWhen it spins them and throws them at high speed,\nthese stars can split metal in two.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "水を　圧縮して　手裏剣を　作り出す。\n高速回転させて　飛ばすと\n金属も　真っ二つ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Comprime el agua y crea estrellas ninja con las que\nataca al enemigo. Cuando las hace girar a gran\nvelocidad cortan en dos hasta el metal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "にんじゃのように　しんしゅつきぼつ。\nすばやい　うごきで　ほんろうしつつ\nみずの　しゅりけんで　きりさく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "닌자처럼 신출귀몰하다.\n재빠른 움직임으로 상대를 농락하면서\n물의 수리검으로 벤다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aussi insaisissable qu’un ninja, il se joue de\nses ennemis grâce à sa célérité, et les tranche\nde ses Sheauriken.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Kaum hat man es erspäht, verschwindet es auch schon\nwieder. Mit der Agilität eines Ninjas verwirrt es seine\nGegner, um sie dann mit Wasser-Shuriken anzugreifen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aparece y desaparece de improvisto, cual ninja. Marea\nal oponente con su soberbia agilidad y lo hace trizas\ncon sus Shuriken de Agua.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Agile e sfuggente come un ninja, si fa beffe dei nemici\ngrazie alla sua velocità e li bersaglia di shuriken\nd’acqua.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It appears and vanishes with a ninja’s grace.\nIt toys with its enemies using swift movements, while\nslicing them with throwing stars of sharpest water.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
